[Unit]
Description=disk-watch: free-space watcher (statvfs, hysteresis, alerts the owner's relay agent over the bus; never deletes anything)
[Service]
Type=oneshot
Environment=OFFICE_TENANT_ROOT=@TENANT@
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 @ROOT@/tools/disk-watch/disk_watch.py
# Thresholds: warn under 25% free, critical under 12% (DISK_WARN_PCT, DISK_CRIT_PCT); DISK_WARN_GB / DISK_CRIT_GB set absolute GB instead. DISK_WATCH_PATH, DISK_WATCH_ALERT_TO. Override with a drop-in.
